/strong> But getting one won't be easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 8 unique settings and conquer 80 challenging levels!</strong> From enchanted forests to dark caves, each environment introduces new puzzles that build upon each other throughout the game, ensuring a constantly innovative experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each scenario brings a fresh challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Push stones to clear paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Connect lasers to the correct braziers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Use reflectors to redirect lasers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more! New mechanics to challenge you. Solve puzzles in the desert, the city, and even the North Pole! \u2744\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Autoplay Available!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a level proves too difficult, watch the step-by-step solution to learn how to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.poster.avif?t=1771419884\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.webm?t=1771419884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/extras/a73db18a8e74297045f6c6ae51c074b7.mp4?t=1771419884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 Steam achievements</strong> to unlock throughout the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_par