.600x338.jpg?t=1771419884"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/72864e30ca9216554e7301fa28168c6d692e1d88/ss_72864e30ca9216554e7301fa28168c6d692e1d88.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771419884","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582540/72864e30ca9216554e7301fa28168c6d692e1d88/ss_72864e30ca9216554e7301fa28168c6d692e1d88.600x338.jpg?t=1771419884"}],"short_description":"Foxxel Quest is a cute and challenging pixel art puzzle game! Help Foxxel find a warm hood while solving 80 unique puzzle levels. Each setting brings a new challenge that builds upon each other throughout the game. With 30 achievements and optional autoplay, it's fun for all ages!","steam_appid":3582540,"support_info":{"email":"shivarygamestudio@gmail.com","url":"https://www.instagram.com/shivarygamestudio/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Indonesian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Korean","type":"game","website":null}